degCycle -- Compute the degree of a cycle of maximal codimension
****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        degCycle(C)
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note toric cycle: ToricCycle,, 
  * Outputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

Description
===========

This function computes the sum of the coefficients of a cycle of maximal
codimension

+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : rayList={{1,0},{1,1},{0,1},{-1,-1}};     |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : coneList={{0,1},{1,2},{2,3},{3,0}};      |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : X = normalToricVariety(rayList,coneList);|
+----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = X_{0,1} + X_{1,2} - 3*X_{2,3}        |
|                                              |
|o4 = - 3*X       + X       + X                |
|          {2, 3}    {0, 1}    {1, 2}          |
|                                              |
|o4 : ToricCycle on X                          |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : degCycle(C)                              |
|                                              |
|o5 = -1                                       |
|                                              |
|o5 : QQ                                       |
+----------------------------------------------+

Ways to use degCycle:
=====================

  * "degCycle(ToricCycle)"

