************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        X_L
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note normal toric variety:
        (NormalToricVarieties)NormalToricVariety,,
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Create a toric cycle directly from the toric variety

+---------------------------------------------+
|i1 : rayList={{1,0},{0,1},{-1,-1},{0,-1}}    |
|                                             |
|o1 = {{1, 0}, {0, 1}, {-1, -1}, {0, -1}}     |
|                                             |
