Description
===========

Another way to get the coefficients of a cycle C

+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : rayList={{1,0},{0,1},{-1,-1},{0,-1}}     |
|                                              |
|o1 = {{1, 0}, {0, 1}, {-1, -1}, {0, -1}}      |
|                                              |
|o1 : List                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : coneList={{0,1},{1,2},{2,3},{3,0}}       |
|                                              |
|o2 = {{0, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}, {3, 0}}         |
|                                              |
|o2 : List                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : X = normalToricVariety(rayList,coneList) |
|                                              |
|o3 = X                                        |
|                                              |
|o3 : NormalToricVariety                       |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = X_{0,1} + X_{0,2} - 2*X_{0,3} + X_{0}|
|                                              |
|o4 = X    + X       + X       - 2*X           |
|      {0}    {0, 1}    {0, 2}      {0, 3}     |
|                                              |
|o4 : ToricCycle on X                          |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C_{0,1}                                  |
|                                              |
|o5 = 1                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i6 : C_{0,2}                                  |
|                                              |
|o6 = 1                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i7 : C_{0,3}                                  |
|                                              |
|o7 = -2                                       |
|                                              |
|o7 : QQ                                       |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i8 : C_0                                      |
|                                              |
|o8 = 1                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+

