|                                |
|o2 = X                          |
|      {0}                       |
|                                |
|o2 : ToricCycle on X            |
+--------------------------------+
|i3 : toricCycle(X_1+X_2)        |
|                                |
|o3 = X    + X                   |
|      {1}    {2}                |
|                                |
|o3 : ToricCycle on X            |
+--------------------------------+

